cks(docked_control)` result in freeing the passed `docked_control`.\r\n\r\nAfter #106503 when a Control is added to a dock with `add_control_from_dock` it is wrapped into an EditorDock node by adding it as its child. On `remove_control_from_docks` such EditorDock is freed, but the wrapped control was never being removed from it, hence it was freed together with its parent. This is a regresion / compatibilty breakage, as `remove_control_from_docks` is documented to not free the passed control and tells clearly it's the user responsibility.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9095a76ff54ff96778c75260ac629cd4d1f1535f/doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml#L681-L686","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"no